<h2><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\"></span></strong></span><strong>1️⃣</strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\">Un peu d\'histoire</span></strong></span><br />
